\ Regression test for a method{ body resolving its defining module's private{ }
\ helpers when dispatched from outside the module.

use "testing" ;
use "method_private_deps_lib.1z" shadow-ok ;

"method body resolves module private deps" test-section

\ describe is a public generic; (decorate) lives only in the library's private
\ deps. Dispatching from here exercises the cross-module path: the method body's
\ call to (decorate) must resolve through the defining module's deps frame.
42 describe "int!" "fixnum method reaches private helper" assert=
t describe "bool!" "boolean method reaches private helper" assert=
